WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.061
In Children, check your class and choose Contact update QR.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.375
Add a label and create the link. It expires after two hours.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.123
Display the QR during class. Copy or print it before closing this dialog.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.103
The form asks for the child’s name and birth date as recorded on the roster.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.820
Add a missing phone number, then submit the details.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.959
Existing numbers stay unchanged. Ask a servant to confirm or correct the saved details.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.342
Back in Contact update QR, close the link when you’re done. Saved details stay on the roster.
